Validation issue code EMG_COORD_SYS_MISMATCH (error). Some values in the coordinate_system column of *_electrodes.tsv are not present as space entities in *_coordsystem.json files. When the file is in the emg datatype directory and the file's suffix is electrodes and columns.coordinate_system, it requires that the length of 

    unique(columns.coordinate_system shares a value with associations.coordsystems.spaces

) == the length of unique(columns.coordinate_system). Failing this check is reported as an ERROR, which makes the dataset invalid. The check is named EMGCoordSysMatch in the BIDS schema. It concerns emg data.

Validation issue code EMG_COORD_SYS_PARENTS (error). Some parent coordinate systems were not found. When the file is in the emg datatype directory and the file's suffix is electrodes and the length of associations.coordsystems.ParentCoordinateSystems, it requires that the length of 

    unique(associations.coordsystems.ParentCoordinateSystems shares a value with associations.coordsystems.spaces

) == the length of unique(associations.coordsystems.ParentCoordinateSystems). Failing this check is reported as an ERROR, which makes the dataset invalid. The check is named EMGCoordSysParents in the BIDS schema. It concerns emg data.

